{"title": "Reasoning Super Practice — Mock #7", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question marks (?) in the given series?</p><p>16, 36, 64, ?, ?, 196, 256, 324</p>", "q_hi": "&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p><p>16, 36, 64, ?, ?, 196, 256, 324", "options_en": ["81, 121", "100, 121", "100, 144", "81, 100"], "options_hi": ["81, 121", "100, 121", "100, 144", "81, 100"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>16 + 20 = 36</p><p>36 + (20+8) = 36 + 28 = 64</p><p>64 + (28+8) = 64 + 36 = <b>100</b></p><p>100 + (36+8) = 100 + 44 = <b>144</b></p><p>144 + (44+8) = 144 + 52 = 196</p><p>196 + (52+8) = 196 + 60 = 256</p><p>256 + (60+8) = 256 + 68 = 324</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>16 + 20 = 36</p><p>36 + (20+8) = 36 + 28 = 64</p><p>64 + (28+8) = 64 + 36 = <b>100</b></p><p>100 + (36+8) = 100 + 44 = <b>144</b></p><p>144 + (44+8) = 144 + 52 = 196</p><p>196 + (52+8) = 196 + 60 = 256</p><p>256 + (60+8) = 256 + 68 = 324</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p><p>66, 75, 86, 99, 114, ?</p>", "q_hi": "&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2361; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;&#2404;</p><p>66, 75, 86, 99, 114, ?", "options_en": ["140", "135", "139", "131"], "options_hi": ["140", "135", "139", "131"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>66, 75, 86, 99, 114, ?</p><p>66 + 9 = 75,</p><p>75 + 11 =86,</p><p>86 + 13 = 99,</p><p>99 + 15 = 114</p><p>And, 114+17=131</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>66, 75, 86, 99, 114, ?</p><p>66 + 9 = 75,</p><p>75 + 11 =86,</p><p>86 + 13 = 99,</p><p>99 + 15 = 114</p><p>And, 114+17=131</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p><p>672, 677, 686, 699, 716, ?</p>", "q_hi": "&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2361; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;&#2404;</p><p>672, 677, 686, 699, 716, ?", "options_en": ["747", "749", "757", "737"], "options_hi": ["747", "749", "757", "737"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Find the differences between successive terms:</p><p>&#8226; 677  -  672 = 5</p><p>&#8226; 686  -  677 = 9</p><p>&#8226; 699  -  686 = 13</p><p>&#8226; 716  -  699 = 17</p><p>The differences increase by 4 each time. The next difference should be 17 + 4 = 21. Therefore, the next term = 716 + 21 = 737.</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Find the differences between successive terms:</p><p>&#8226; 677  -  672 = 5</p><p>&#8226; 686  -  677 = 9</p><p>&#8226; 699  -  686 = 13</p><p>&#8226; 716  -  699 = 17</p><p>The differences increase by 4 each time. The next difference should be 17 + 4 = 21. Therefore, the next term = 716 + 21 = 737.</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p><p>9, 5, 6, 10.5, 23, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2361; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;&#2404;</p><p>9, 5, 6, 10.5, 23, ?</p>", "options_en": ["80", "90", "60", "50"], "options_hi": ["80", "90", "60", "50"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>9 x 0.5 + 0.5 = 4.5 + 0.5 = 5</p><p>5 x 1 + 1 = 5 + 1 = 6</p><p>6 x 1.5 + 1.5 = 9 + 1.5 = 10.5</p><p>10)5 x 2 + 2 = 21 + 2 = 23</p><p>23 x 2.5 + 2.5 = 57.5 + 2.5 = 60</p><p>So, option 3 is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>9 x 0.5 + 0.5 = 4.5 + 0.5 = 5</p><p>5 x 1 + 1 = 5 + 1 = 6</p><p>6 x 1.5 + 1.5 = 9 + 1.5 = 10.5</p><p>10)5 x 2 + 2 = 21 + 2 = 23</p><p>23 x 2.5 + 2.5 = 57.5 + 2.5 = 60</p><p>So, option 3 is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p><p>98, 50, 26, 14, ?, 5</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2361; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;&#2404;</p><p>98, 50, 26, 14, ?, 5</p>", "options_en": ["10", "6", "7", "8"], "options_hi": ["10", "6", "7", "8"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>98 &div; 2 + 1 = 49 + 1 = 50</p><p>50 &div; 2 + 1 = 25 + 1 = 26</p><p>26 &div; 2 + 1 = 13 + 1 = 14</p><p><b>14 &div; 2 + 1 = 7 + 1 = 8</b></p><p>8 &div; 2 + 1 = 4 + 1 = 5</p><p>So, option (4) is the correct answer. </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>98 &div; 2 + 1 = 49 + 1 = 50</p><p>50 &div; 2 + 1 = 25 + 1 = 26</p><p>26 &div; 2 + 1 = 13 + 1 = 14</p><p><b>14 &div; 2 + 1 = 7 + 1 = 8</b></p><p>8 &div; 2 + 1 = 4 + 1 = 5</p><p>So, option (4) is the correct answer. </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p><p>58, 179, ?, 492, 688</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>58, 179, ?, 492, 688</p>", "options_en": ["300", "269", "313", "323"], "options_hi": ["300", "269", "313", "323"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>58, 179, ?, 492, 688</p><p><img width=298 height=107 id=\"Picture 54\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21334/image022.png\" alt=1.png></p><p>58 + (11)&#178; = 58 + 121= 179</p><p><b>179 + (12)&#178; = 179 + 144 = 323</b></p><p>323 + (13)&#178; = 323 + 169 = 492</p><p>492 + (14)&#178; = 492 + 196 = 688</p><p>So, '323' will replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>58, 179, ?, 492, 688</p><p><img width=298 height=107 id=\"Picture 54\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21334/image022.png\" alt=1.png></p><p>58 + (11)&#178; = 58 + 121= 179</p><p><b>179 + (12)&#178; = 179 + 144 = 323</b></p><p>323 + (13)&#178; = 323 + 169 = 492</p><p>492 + (14)&#178; = 492 + 196 = 688</p><p>So, '323' will replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p><p>189, 532, 316, ?, 377</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>189, 532, 316, ?, 377</p>", "options_en": ["384", "291", "441", "405"], "options_hi": ["384", "291", "441", "405"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p><img width=270 height=100 id=\"Picture 70\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21347/image054.png\" alt=1.png></p><p>189 + (7)&ge; = 189 + 343 = 532</p><p>532  -  (6)&ge; = 532  -  216 = 316</p><p>316 + (5)&ge; = 316 + 125 = 441</p><p>441  -  (4)&ge; = 441  -  64 = 377</p><p>So, '441' will replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=270 height=100 id=\"Picture 70\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21347/image054.png\" alt=1.png></p><p>189 + (7)&ge; = 189 + 343 = 532</p><p>532  -  (6)&ge; = 532  -  216 = 316</p><p>316 + (5)&ge; = 316 + 125 = 441</p><p>441  -  (4)&ge; = 441  -  64 = 377</p><p>So, '441' will replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What should come in place of the question mark (?) in the given series?</p><p>18, 74, 298, 1194, 4778, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2358;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2351;&#2375;?</p><p>18, 74, 298, 1194, 4778, ?</p>", "options_en": ["19112", "19114", "19110", "19116"], "options_hi": ["19112", "19114", "19110", "19116"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>The logic is:</p><p><img width=526 height=50 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image032.png\"></p><p>Hence, missing term = 19114</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>The logic is:</p><p><img width=526 height=50 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image032.png\"></p><p>Hence, missing term = 19114</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p><p>337, 354, 373, 394, 417, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2361; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;&#2404;</p><p>337, 354, 373, 394, 417, ?</p>", "options_en": ["446", "444", "440", "442"], "options_hi": ["446", "444", "440", "442"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>337 + 17 = 354</p><p>354 + 19 = 373</p><p>373 + 21 = 394</p><p>394 + 23 = 417 </p><p>417 + 25 = 442</p><p>So, option (d) is the correct answer. </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>337 + 17 = 354</p><p>354 + 19 = 373</p><p>373 + 21 = 394</p><p>394 + 23 = 417 </p><p>417 + 25 = 442</p><p>So, option (d) is the correct answer. </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question mark (?) in the given series?</p><p>8, 15, 26, ? , 56, 75</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2358;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2327;&#2368;?</p><p>8, 15, 26, ? , 56, 75</p>", "options_en": ["39", "41", "35", "43"], "options_hi": ["39", "41", "35", "43"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>The logic is: (Difference of prime numbers.)</p><p>8 + 7 = 15</p><p>15 + 11 = 26</p><p>26 + 13 = <b>39</b></p><p>39 + 17 = 56</p><p>56 + 19 = 75</p><p>Hence, missing term = 39</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>The logic is: (Difference of prime numbers.)</p><p>8 + 7 = 15</p><p>15 + 11 = 26</p><p>26 + 13 = <b>39</b></p><p>39 + 17 = 56</p><p>56 + 19 = 75</p><p>Hence, missing term = 39</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question mark (?) in the given series?</p><p>12, 25, 49, ?, 197, 395</p>", "q_hi": "&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p><p>12, 25, 49, ?, 197, 395", "options_en": ["100", "121", "99", "96"], "options_hi": ["100", "121", "99", "96"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Here the order is:-</p><p>12*2+1=25</p><p>25*2-1=49</p><p>49*2+1=99</p><p>And 99*2-1=197</p><p>197*2+1=395.</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here the order is:-</p><p>12*2+1=25</p><p>25*2-1=49</p><p>49*2+1=99</p><p>And 99*2-1=197</p><p>197*2+1=395.</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question mark (?) in the given series? </p><p>17, 38, 84, ?, 376, 772</p>", "q_hi": "&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p><p>17, 38, 84, ?, 376, 772", "options_en": ["190", "200", "180", "150"], "options_hi": ["190", "200", "180", "150"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>17, 38, 84, ?, 376, 772</p><p>17*2+4=38,</p><p>38*2+8=84,</p><p>84*2+12=<b>180</b></p><p>180*2+16=376</p><p>376*2+20=772</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>17, 38, 84, ?, 376, 772</p><p>17*2+4=38,</p><p>38*2+8=84,</p><p>84*2+12=<b>180</b></p><p>180*2+16=376</p><p>376*2+20=772</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question mark (?) in the given series?</p><p>7, 16, 43, 124, 367, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p><p>7, 16, 43, 124, 367, ?</p>", "options_en": ["1086", "1066", "1076", "1096"], "options_hi": ["1086", "1066", "1076", "1096"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>16, 43, 124, 367, ?</p><p>16 + 33 = 43,</p><p>43 + 34 = 124,</p><p>124 + 35 = 367,</p><p>367 + 36 = 1096</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>16, 43, 124, 367, ?</p><p>16 + 33 = 43,</p><p>43 + 34 = 124,</p><p>124 + 35 = 367,</p><p>367 + 36 = 1096</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the number that will replace the question mark (?) in the following number series. </p><p>1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, ?</p>", "options_en": ["20", "24", "21", "22"], "options_hi": ["20", "24", "21", "22"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, ?</p><p>Here it follows a fibonacci series (each number is the sum of two preceding numbers)</p><p>1 + 0 = 1,</p><p>1 + 1 = 2,</p><p>1 + 2 = 3,</p><p>2 + 3 = 5,</p><p>3 + 5 = 8,</p><p>5 + 8 =13,</p><p>8 + 13 = 21</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, ?</p><p>Here it follows a fibonacci series (each number is the sum of two preceding numbers)</p><p>1 + 0 = 1,</p><p>1 + 1 = 2,</p><p>1 + 2 = 3,</p><p>2 + 3 = 5,</p><p>3 + 5 = 8,</p><p>5 + 8 =13,</p><p>8 + 13 = 21</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series. </p><p>25, 40, 70, 115, 175, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2361; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;&#2404;</p><p>25, 40, 70, 115, 175, ?</p>", "options_en": ["275", "225", "200", "250"], "options_hi": ["275", "225", "200", "250"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>25, 40, 70, 115, 175, ?</p><p>25 + 15*1 = 40,</p><p>40 + 15*2 = 70,</p><p>70 + 15*3 = 115,</p><p>115 + 15*4 = 175,</p><p>175 + 15*5 = 250</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>25, 40, 70, 115, 175, ?</p><p>25 + 15*1 = 40,</p><p>40 + 15*2 = 70,</p><p>70 + 15*3 = 115,</p><p>115 + 15*4 = 175,</p><p>175 + 15*5 = 250</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question marks (?) in the given series? </p><p>1, 6, 15, 28, ?, ?, 91 </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p><p>1, 6, 15, 28, ?, ?, 91 </p>", "options_en": ["42, 54", "44, 54", "45, 66", "40, 60"], "options_hi": ["42, 54", "44, 54", "45, 66", "40, 60"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>We have:-</p><p>1, 6, 15, 28, ?, ?, 91 </p><p>1 + 5 = 6 ; 5 + 4 = 9</p><p>6 + 9 = 15 ; 9 + 4 = 13</p><p>15 + 13 = 28 ; 13 + 4 = 17</p><p>28 + 17 = <b>45</b> ; 17 + 4 = 21</p><p>45 + 21 = <b>66</b> ; 21 + 4 = 25</p><p>66 + 25 = 91</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We have:-</p><p>1, 6, 15, 28, ?, ?, 91 </p><p>1 + 5 = 6 ; 5 + 4 = 9</p><p>6 + 9 = 15 ; 9 + 4 = 13</p><p>15 + 13 = 28 ; 13 + 4 = 17</p><p>28 + 17 = <b>45</b> ; 17 + 4 = 21</p><p>45 + 21 = <b>66</b> ; 21 + 4 = 25</p><p>66 + 25 = 91</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question mark (?) in the given series? </p><p>12, 13, 30, 99, 412, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p><p>12, 13, 30, 99, 412, ?</p>", "options_en": ["2075", "2065", "2085", "2055"], "options_hi": ["2075", "2065", "2085", "2055"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>12, 13, 30, 99, 412, ?</p><p>12*1 + 1<sup>2</sup> = 13,</p><p>13*2 + 2<sup>2</sup> = 30,</p><p>30*3 + 3<sup>2</sup> = 99,</p><p>99*4 + 4<sup>2</sup> = 412,</p><p>412*5 + 5<sup>2</sup> = <b>2085</b></p><p>Option(c) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>12, 13, 30, 99, 412, ?</p><p>12*1 + 1<sup>2</sup> = 13,</p><p>13*2 + 2<sup>2</sup> = 30,</p><p>30*3 + 3<sup>2</sup> = 99,</p><p>99*4 + 4<sup>2</sup> = 412,</p><p>412*5 + 5<sup>2</sup> = <b>2085</b></p><p>Option(c) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question mark (?) in the given series? </p><p>324, 722, 1200, ?, 2420</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p><p>324, 722, 1200, ?, 2420</p>", "options_en": ["1736", "1632", "1764", "1634"], "options_hi": ["1736", "1632", "1764", "1634"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>324, 722, 1200, ?, 2420</p><p><img width=292 height=140 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p28235/image033.png\"></p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We have the series as:-</p><p>324, 722, 1200, ?, 2420</p><p><img width=292 height=140 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p28235/image033.png\"></p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series. </p><p>115, 140, 160, 175, 185, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2361; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;&#2404;</p><p>115, 140, 160, 175, 185, ?</p>", "options_en": ["192", "193", "195", "190"], "options_hi": ["192", "193", "195", "190"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>115 + 25 = 140</p><p>140 + 20 = 160</p><p>160 + 15 = 175</p><p>175 + 10 = 185</p><p>185 + 5 = <b>190</b></p><p>Thus, the answer is option (d).</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>115 + 25 = 140</p><p>140 + 20 = 160</p><p>160 + 15 = 175</p><p>175 + 10 = 185</p><p>185 + 5 = <b>190</b></p><p>Thus, the answer is option (d).</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following numbers will replace the question mark (?) in the given series?</p><p>29, 30, 26, 35, 19, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p><p>29, 30, 26, 35, 19, ?</p>", "options_en": ["43", "42", "41", "44"], "options_hi": ["43", "42", "41", "44"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>29 + 1<sup>2</sup> = 29 + 1 = 30</p><p>30  -  2<sup>2 </sup>= 30  -  4 = 26</p><p>26 + 3<sup>2</sup> = 26 + 9 = 35</p><p>35  -  4<sup>2</sup> = 35  -  16 = 19</p><p>19 + 5<sup>2</sup> = 19 + 25 = <b>44</b></p><p>Thus, the answer is option (d).</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>29 + 1<sup>2</sup> = 29 + 1 = 30</p><p>30  -  2<sup>2 </sup>= 30  -  4 = 26</p><p>26 + 3<sup>2</sup> = 26 + 9 = 35</p><p>35  -  4<sup>2</sup> = 35  -  16 = 19</p><p>19 + 5<sup>2</sup> = 19 + 25 = <b>44</b></p><p>Thus, the answer is option (d).</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}]}